 "segments": [
  "[  0.00-  2.96] They buried a man alive with a bell tied to his finger.",
  "[  3.16-  5.84] You see, people were so scared of waking up in a coffin",
  "[  5.84-  8.04] that graves came with a little bell on top,",
  "[  8.20-  9.94] tied by a string to the body's finger.",
  "[ 10.06- 12.54] Except when his bell starts ringing at two in the morning,",
  "[ 12.90- 15.08] the guy next door decides it's probably the wind.",
  "[ 15.32- 16.54] Then it rings faster.",
  "[ 16.78- 18.90] And now the whole street is out on their porches,",
  "[ 19.06- 20.12] going, you go check!",
  "[ 20.40- 21.46] No, you go check!",
  "[ 21.66- 23.38] Somebody drags the doctor out of bed,",
  "[ 23.56- 25.54] and he goes, bodies twitch, he's dead.",
  "[ 25.74- 26.78] I signed the paper myself.",
  "[ 27.04- 28.68] But his wife isn't on her porch.",
  "[ 28.68- 31.06] She's sitting in the dark with a shovel by the door,",
  "[ 31.22- 32.48] because she knows that ring.",
  "[ 32.74- 33.94] Three short, one long.",
  "[ 34.14- 35.58] The exact signal they practiced.",
  "[ 35.92- 36.62] Wait, practiced?",
  "[ 37.00- 38.26] Well, he was never dead.",
  "[ 38.44- 39.84] He owed money to half the town,",
  "[ 39.98- 41.12] so he faked his death.",
  "[ 41.30- 42.54] And the second that bell rang,",
  "[ 42.72- 44.06] she was supposed to grab the shovel,",
  "[ 44.30- 45.86] dig him up, and skip town with him.",
  "[ 45.96- 47.96] Instead, she just sits there all night,",
  "[ 48.14- 50.06] listening to it ring fast, then slow,",
  "[ 50.26- 51.44] then once every few minutes,",
  "[ 51.66- 53.66] until sunrise, when it finally stops.",
  "[ 54.00- 55.28] You see, with him in the ground,",
  "[ 55.60- 57.72] every debt got buried right along with him,",
  "[ 57.72- 59.22] and the house was all hers."
 ],
